<template><div><h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Open the swamp and weapon routes</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-open" data-guide-step>Open Doctor’s Quarters, Dig Site and the Fishing, Comms and Storage huts. Locate Dig Site Pack-a-Punch and plan armour/perk upgrades before the ceremony. Use water paths and the zipline to reach the huts; the free Wunderwaffe’s last tube needs Zaballa’s round-15 arrival.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-wunderwaffe">Build or obtain the Wunderwaffe DG-2</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-barrel" data-guide-step>Take the weapon barrel from Fishing Hut’s shelf near its door. Put it on the radio tower outside Comms. At the NEXT round’s start, defend the tower after its lightning strike. Retrieve the charged barrel and take the first charged vacuum tube from the radio inside Comms.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0043.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0043.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Fishing Hut weapon-barrel pickup&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Fishing Hut weapon-barrel pickup&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0043&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0044.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0044.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Comms radio tower receiving the barrel&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Comms radio tower receiving the barrel&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0044&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0046.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0046.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Charged first tube at the Comms radio&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Charged first tube at the Comms radio&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0046&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-fuse" data-guide-step>Collect the electrical fuse from Comms’ table. Activate Storage’s trap and let it short out; when its red box opens, fit the fuse and restart it. Feed the repaired trap zombie kills until the tube on the Storage workbench lights, then collect it.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0047.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0047.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Comms electrical-fuse pickup&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Comms electrical-fuse pickup&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0047&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0050.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0050.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Opened Storage trap fuse box&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Opened Storage trap fuse box&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0050&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0051.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0051.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Second charged vacuum tube&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Second charged vacuum tube&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0051&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-zaballa-tube" data-guide-step>From round 15, lure Zaballa into the Excavation/War Room and stand by its Tesla coil to bait her energy mines into it. After the coil has received enough hits (the reference specifies five), take the charged tube from the adjacent table.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0052.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0052.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Tesla coil in Excavation/War Room&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Tesla coil in Excavation/War Room&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0052&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0054.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0054.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Third vacuum tube beside the charged coil&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Third vacuum tube beside the charged coil&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0054&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-craft" data-guide-step>With the barrel and all three charged tubes, craft the Wunderwaffe at Storage’s workbench. A mystery-box Wunderwaffe is an alternative acquisition and satisfies the weapon need without these build tasks. Upgrade it and keep ammunition ready before the ceremony.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0055.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0055.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Storage Wunderwaffe crafting workbench&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Storage Wunderwaffe crafting workbench&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0055&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-monolith">Clear the monolith and read the three papers</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-vines" data-guide-step>At Doctor’s Quarters Exterior, lure three Boom-Schreier explosions next to the vine-covered monolith. Clear the vines before interacting with its wheel assembly.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0056.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0056.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Vine-covered Doctor’s Quarters monolith&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Vine-covered Doctor’s Quarters monolith&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0056&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-wheels" data-guide-step>Collect the three wheel PARTS: Dormitory’s table to the right of M1 Garand, Doctor’s Quarters’ room to the right of its Demonic Fountain, and Dig Site’s table in front of Pack-a-Punch. Install them on the cleared monolith. These parts are not the answer papers.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0057.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0057.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dormitory cipher-wheel part&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dormitory cipher-wheel part&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0057&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0058.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0058.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Doctor’s Quarters cipher-wheel part&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Doctor’s Quarters cipher-wheel part&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0058&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0059.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0059.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dig Site cipher-wheel part&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dig Site cipher-wheel part&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0059&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-papers" data-guide-step>Read the three variable paper glyphs: Excavation/War Room’s table (shoot away covering books if needed), the Dig Site workbench, and Comms’ table to the left of its connecting doorway. Keep each observation labelled by location.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0060.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0060.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Excavation paper beneath destructible books&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Excavation paper beneath destructible books&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0060&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0061.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0061.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dig Site workbench paper&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dig Site workbench paper&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0061&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0062.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0062.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Comms table paper&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Comms table paper&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0062&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-translate" data-guide-step>Use the paired reference plate below, or reveal the complete in-game Doctor’s Quarters translation sheet with a Molotov/thermite. Translate each PAPER glyph to its paired wheel marking. Align the three required markings at the top of the wheel and lock it; red lighting and the appearing ceremony stones confirm acceptance. Do not assume hut visit order supplies ring order.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0063.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0063.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;All fifteen paper-to-wheel pairs; each cell has paper left and wheel marking right&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;All fifteen paper-to-wheel pairs; each cell has paper left and wheel marking right&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:618,&quot;height&quot;:416,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0063&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="vanguard-shi-no-numa-cipher" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-souls">Complete the Wunderwaffe ceremony</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-ceremony" data-guide-step>Have a Wunderwaffe ready. All players interact with their glowing stones together to start the lockdown. Kill blue-mist enemies near the shrine with the Wunderwaffe before the event ends. A blue orb and conversation indicate success; if collection fails, start another attempt next round.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0065.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0065.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Ceremony start stone&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Ceremony start stone&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0065&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0066.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0066.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Blue-mist enemy requiring a Wunderwaffe kill&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Blue-mist enemy requiring a Wunderwaffe kill&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0066&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-blood">Fill and drink the blood fountain</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-flogger-blood" data-guide-step>Use Flogger kills in its Courtyard to fill the empty Demonic Fountain. Once filled, drink for the temporary Zombie Blood vision. Zombies still see and attack you during this effect; refill/drink again when you need another clue window.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0067.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0067.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Blood fountain in Flogger Courtyard&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Blood fountain in Flogger Courtyard&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0067&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-mirror-parts">Find both mirror fragments in vision</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-map-x" data-guide-step>While in vision, read War Room’s map for the red X. Go to its indicated hut, shoot the fragment in the ceiling to drop it and collect it. The X varies; use the map actually shown, not a fixed hut choice.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0068.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0068.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;War Room map carrying the current red X&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;War Room map carrying the current red X&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0068&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0069.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0069.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Elevated mirror fragment to shoot down&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Elevated mirror fragment to shoot down&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0069&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-red-orb" data-guide-step>Find the red orb in the main building during vision and approach to start it moving. Its start identifies the eventual fragment location below; it can finish without a continuous escort. If vision expires, drink again and search its endpoint.<ul><li>Upper floor beside SVT-50 → trees left of Doctor’s Quarters.</li><li>Lower floor by the box → Fishing Hut’s back room.</li><li>Lower floor near the Storage door → central Dig Site by the ammo crate.</li></ul><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0070.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0070.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red orb visible in blood vision&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red orb visible in blood vision&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0070&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0072.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0072.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Doctor’s Quarters endpoint&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Doctor’s Quarters endpoint&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0072&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0074.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0074.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Fishing Hut endpoint&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Fishing Hut endpoint&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0074&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0076.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0076.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dig Site endpoint&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dig Site endpoint&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0076&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-orbs">Restore the mirror and return blue orbs</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-place-mirror" data-guide-step>Install both fragments on Dig Site’s central pedestal. Interact with your blue orb’s stone; its position identifies the hut-side orb route. Find the orb and shoot its successive positions until it returns to Dig Site. The route uses three shots; an expired attempt respawns at its start stone for another try.<ul><li>Stone nearest Combat Shotgun → Fishing Hut Exterior tree left of the Tome.</li><li>Stone nearest Pack-a-Punch → Comms back-room ceiling.</li><li>Stone west of the mirror → bushes left of Doctor’s Quarters.</li><li>Stone north of the mirror → Storage window right of the ammo crate.</li></ul><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0078.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0078.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Central Dig Site mirror pedestal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Central Dig Site mirror pedestal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0078&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0081.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0081.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Fishing Hut Exterior blue orb&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Fishing Hut Exterior blue orb&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0081&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0083.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0083.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Comms back-room blue orb&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Comms back-room blue orb&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0083&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0085.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0085.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Doctor’s Quarters blue orb&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Doctor’s Quarters blue orb&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0085&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0087.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0087.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Storage window blue orb&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Storage window blue orb&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0087&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-echo">Defeat the Echo’s three masks</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-enter-echo" data-guide-step>Prepare upgrades, armour, Wunderwaffe ammo and your damage weapon. All players interact with the returned blue orbs to summon the Echo, then allow its introductory dialogue to finish.</li>
<li id="guide-step-vshi-echo-loop" data-guide-step>Charge the mirror by Wunderwaffe-killing the required marked enemies near it. When the large blue dome forms, bring the Echo INSIDE it and damage its mask before it recovers. Insufficient damage resets that mask’s damage window; recharge and repeat.<ul><li>Mask 1 collection: blue-mist zombies.</li><li>Mask 2 collection: Boom-Schreiers.</li><li>Mask 3 collection: Sturmkriegers.</li></ul><p class="guide-callout">Choose an artifact for the damage window and survival. A source’s high-tier Energy Mine strategy is an option, not a guaranteed one-hit promise or a game prerequisite.</p></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-mirror">Collect the restored relic</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-mirror-finish" data-guide-step>After all three masks are destroyed, let the concluding story events finish and collect the repaired mirror relic and rewards. The first weakened mask is not quest completion.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-rampage">Rampage Inducer</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-rampage" data-guide-step>From the main building, quickly shoot five outside lanterns in order: left of SVT-50, right of SVT-50, behind the stairs, the right side of the window left of G-43, then the left side of that window. Successful hits flash orange; a sound and tablet indicate the inducer is available.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-bunny">Blood-vision Mister Peeks reward</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-bunny" data-guide-step>First unlock the blood-fountain vision in the main quest. While in vision, collect three bunny parts: under the zipline platform; in water outside Fishing Hut; and at the former box position WHILE the box is moving. All three produce bonus points and a Fire Sale. These items are not visible as a fresh-spawn route.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-samantha">Samantha’s Sorrow and Max Ammo</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-samantha" data-guide-step>Shoot four silver plates on Fishing Hut’s walls, then interact with the Samantha doll on the side-room floor. Shoot the dolls appearing one at a time along the bridge outside. Return to the starting doll and interact again for the song and Max Ammo.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-telephone-music">The One instrumental</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-vshi-phone" data-guide-step>Interact with the black telephone inside Comms to start The One’s instrumental track.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/VG/shi_no_numa_reborn/shi_no_numa_reborn_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.codzombieguides.com/shi-no-numa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">codzombieguides.com reference (2) ↗</a></li></ul><p>Select any reference image to enlarge it. Screenshot and symbol sources are credited in the linked walkthroughs; this guide uses local copies for reliable access.</p></section></div></template>
